WEBVTT

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:30.934
representing Mongolia
at international festivals,

00:01:30.958 --> 00:01:37.438
living and studying in places like Japan,
China, Finland, Germany and Sweden.

00:01:37.818 --> 00:01:39.649
But then suddenly,

00:01:39.673 --> 00:01:41.298
when I was 21,

00:01:41.322 --> 00:01:43.767
I lost my loving mother,

00:01:43.791 --> 00:01:45.530
and just two years later

00:01:45.554 --> 00:01:47.095
I lost my father.

00:01:47.952 --> 00:01:49.731
As an only child,

00:01:49.755 --> 00:01:52.032
I was devastated and lonely.

00:01:52.881 --> 00:01:56.781
At the time, the only thing
I had left was my country,

00:01:56.805 --> 00:01:59.220
so I decided to move home.